    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more specific project details, it is challenging to provide tailored cost-optimisation strategies. our minimum acceptable margin percentage is 18, and any proposal would need to ensure that our meet or exceed 18 while also considering our fixed and variable costs, which are typically split at 35 percent and 65 percent of the project cost, respectively." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires an artificial intelligence solution that assists agents in agents administrative activities, improves answer quality, reduces processing times, and provides contextualized answers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we design the AI components to meet these requirements, and what innovation strategy can we propose to ensure the solution remains effective and efficient over time?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To design the AI components I would recommend leveraging we existing capabilities in large language models and retrieval-augmented generation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, deploying a model like Mistral 7B Instruct, which is we preferred sovereign model due to Mistral 7B Instruct, which is our preferred sovereign model due to its strong performance on French-language tasks and compliance with EU regulations strong performance on French-language tasks and compliance with EU regulations, can provide high-quality answers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve answer quality and provide contextualized responses, we can implement Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities, utilizing techniques such as dense vector semantic retrieval or hybrid strategies that fuse different retrieval methods." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) allows for the incorporation of external knowledge sources, ensuring that the model's responses are not only accurate but also up-to-date and relevant to the specific context of administrative activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To reduce processing times, we can apply quantization methods like INT8 or explore more advanced techniques such as GGUF, which have been shown to significantly reduce computational requirements without a substantial loss in performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Fine-tuning the model on a domain-specific corpus will also be essential to adapt the language understanding and generation capabilities to the nuances of administrative tasks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For we innovation strategy, we propose a multi-phase approach that includes ongoing research and development aligned with current topics such as knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and proactive regulatory change alerting. a multi-phase approach that includes ongoing research and development aligned with current topics such as knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and proactive regulatory change alerting will enable we to continuously enhance the AI solution's ability to understand complex administrative procedures and adapt to changing regulatory environments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, adopting an agile development methodology with regular iterations (every 9 months, as indicated by we typical V1 to V2 cycle) allows for the incorporation of user feedback, ensuring that the AI solution's remains aligned with evolving needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Quarterly evaluations on diverse test sets will also be conducted to monitor and mitigate any biases in the AI's decision-making processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By integrating these strategies, we can ensure a robust, compliant, and innovative AI solution that not only meets but exceeds The tender requirements, offering significant value to administrative agents through improved efficiency, accuracy, and contextual relevance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client prioritizes environmental sustainability and requires that the solution contribute to reducing energetic consumption and rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What CSR and sustainability measures can we implement to meet these requirements, and how can we demonstrate we commitment to sustainable development?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The client requirements for environmental sustainability, we can implement several measures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, we can leverage we partnership with green hosting providers such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which are based in France and utilize 100% renewable energy, ensuring a low carbon footprint for we infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, green hosting providers such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which are based in France and utilize 100% renewable energy have achieved ISO14001 certification, further demonstrating green hosting providers such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which are based in France and utilize 100% renewable energy commitment to environmental management. we can also apply digital sobriety practices that reduce energy consumption. digital sobriety practices that reduce energy consumption includes techniques like INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy by approximately 40%, and auto-scaling to zero outside business hours to minimize unnecessary power usage." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, implementing query result caching is estimated to reduce recomputations by about 20%, contributing to lower energy demands. we green IT hardware procurement policy ensures that we prioritize equipment with a minimum lifecycle of five years, reducing electronic waste and the environmental impacts associated with frequent hardware replacements. we also have a partnership with Ecologic in France for responsible e-waste management, ensuring that we discarded electronics are recycled according to WEEE standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To demonstrate our commitment to sustainable development, we can utilize we carbon reporting capability, which follows GRI Standards (albeit partially), to provide transparent insights into we carbon footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "On average, we practices result in a 35% reduction in energy consumption compared to baseline operations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By adopting these measures and continuing to evolve we sustainability strategies, such as working towards achieving ISO14001 certification by 2026 and maintaining a Silver rating from Ecovadis with a score of 62, we demonstrate we dedication to reducing environmental impact and supporting sustainable development. our dedication to reducing environmental impact and supporting sustainable development includes striving for net-zero emissions by 2040 and regularly assessing our carbon footprint, as evidenced by the bilan carbone conducted in 2023." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. proposes the implementation of an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions, improving efficiency and quality of service. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, improving efficiency and quality of service will provide an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from municipal agents work environment, facilitating access to information, drafting of letters and answers, instruction of files, and suggestion of actions. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, improving efficiency and quality of service will cover functionalities such as assistance with consultation of information, drafting, instruction of files, and collaboration and continuity of processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will ensure that an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, improving efficiency and quality of service integrates into existing practices, providing a contextualized response time below 2 seconds, and guaranteeing high availability of 99.92%, compatible with municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. architecture involves deploying an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions, improving efficiency and quality of service on sovereign cloud infrastructure, such as SecNumCloud, utilizing containerization with Docker and Kubernetes for efficient deployment and scaling." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API integration will be facilitated through API gateways like Kong, ensuring secure and managed access to existing information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For user directory integration, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will leverage identity providers like Keycloak or FranceConnect." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. confirm that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. standard data residency is EU-only, aligning with the tender's requirement, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. cross-border transfer policy prohibits transfers outside EU unless an explicit legal basis is established." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. anonymisation tools include Microsoft Presidio and custom NER models for pseudonymisation of sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will ensure GDPR compliance through Nexus Engineering S.r.l." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
