    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. experience with regulatory frameworks includes GDPR, EU AI Act, and other relevant directives, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have ISO 27001 certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. propose leveraging Nexus Engineering S.r.l. existing capabilities in large language models and retrieval-augmented generation, deploying a model like Mistral 7B Instruct, which is Nexus Engineering S.r.l. preferred sovereign model due to a model like Mistral 7B Instruct, which is our preferred sovereign model due to its strong performance on French-language tasks and compliance with EU regulations strong performance on French-language tasks and compliance with EU regulations." ;
