    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In conclusion, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. is well-positioned to support the implementation of an artificial intelligence solution for the City of Belval, ensuring strict GDPR compliance, high availability, and environmental sustainability." ;
